KING   IS   WHATEVENTUALLY GOT HIM INVOLVED.     ÏPERATION ÓOUTHHALL IS THE NAMEGIVEN TO ONE OF THE LARGEST BUSTS EVERCONDUCTED IN THE ÕNITED ËINGDOM.  ÉTWAS A COMBINED EFFORT BETWEEN ÂRITISHÔELECOM (SIMILAR TO OUR LOCAL TELEPHONECOMPANIES HERE IN THE STATES) ANDÂRITISH POLICE, ACTING ON BEHALF OFÆ.Á.Ó.Ô. (ÆEDERATION ÁGAINST ÓOFTWAREÔHEFT), A WIDESPREAD CITIZEN'S GROUPDEVOTED TO STOPPING ÇREAT ÂRITAIN'SSOFTWARE PIRACY "PROBLEMS".  ÓTUART WASONE OF THE PEOPLE THAT WAS BUSTEDDURING ÏPERATION ÓOUTHHALL, AND HASLEARNED  A  LOT  ABOUT  ABOUT  ITSPROCEDURES WHILE TALKING WITH THEAUTHORITIES.  ÉN FACT, THE MAJORITY OFTHE INFORMATION USED IN THIS ARTICLEWAS PROVIDED BY ÓTUART.  ÈE SAID THATÂRITISH ÔELECOM WAS MAINLY INTERESTEDIN THE CONFISCATION OF ILLEGAL "METERSUPRESSION DEVICES", MORE COMMONLYKNOWN TO PHREAKS AS "BLACK BOXES",WHICH ARE MECHANICAL DEVICES USED TOMAKE/RECEIVE TELEPHONE CALLS FOR FREE.ÉN FACT, ÏPERATION ÓOUTHHALL WASCONDUCTED PRIMARILY FOR THAT PURPOSE.ÂRITISH ÔELECOM BELIEVES THEIR ACTIONSDURING  ÏPERATION  ÓOUTHHALL  WEREENTIRELY NECESSARY, AS THEY CLAIM TO BELOSING IN THE RANGE OF 5,000,000 POUNDSPER YEAR (APPROX. 7,500,000 ÁMERICANDOLLARS) TO TELEPHONE FRAUD.     ÓTUART HAS ALSO LEARNED THATÏPERATION ÓOUTHHALL WAS PLANNED BY LAWENFORCEMENT AGENCIES FOR ABOUT 9 MONTHSBEFORE IT WAS CARRIED OUT ON ÁPRIL 5TH,1990.  ÏRIGINALLY, IT WAS PLANNED TO BEJUST A SERIES OF SEARCHES SET UP BYÂRITISH ÔELECOM TO TAKE CARE OF BLACKBOX USAGE.  ÁBOUT THAT TIME Æ.Á.Ó.Ô.LEARNED OF THIS PROBLEM AND HOW ITRELATED TO SOFTWARE PIRACY.  ÓINCETHERE WAS MORE TO THIS THAN JUST BLACKBOXES, IT WAS DECIDED THAT A FULL-SCALERAID SHOULD BE CONDUCTED.     ÉMAGE'S HOUSE WAS FIRST VISITED BYTHE AUTHORITIES (6-7 POLICE OFFICERSFROM A SPECIAL TASK FORCE AND 2 ÂRITISHÔELECOM PERSONNEL) AT ABOUT 7AM THATMORNING.  ÉN ADDITION, 12 OTHER PEOPLEWERE  BUSTED  ABOUT  THAT  SAME  TIMETHROUGHOUT ÅNGLAND, AND SOME PLACES INÓCOTLAND.  É HAVE A PARTIAL LISTING OFTHOSE PEOPLE, HOWEVER, É AM NOT GOINGTO  LIST  THEM  BECAUSE  É  HAVE  NOTVERIFIED THEM.     ÓTUART'S   HOUSE   WAS   SEARCHEDTHOROUGHLY FOR APPROXIMATELY 4 HOURS,DURING  WHICH  TIME  HIS  WHITE  BOX(SIMILAR TO A BLACK BOX, BUT CAN ONLYRECIEVE  CALLS  FOR  FREE)  WASCONFISCATED.  ÉN ADDITON TO THAT, HISCOMPUTER EQUIPMENT, DISKS, CODES, ANDMISCELLANEOUS PAPERS WERE ALSO TAKEN.ÔHE AUTHORITIES ALSO TOOK 2 PICTURES INÓTUART'S ROOM: ONE OF HIS COMPUTERSETUP AND THE OTHER OF HIS WHITE BOXSETUP.  ÓTU SAYS THAT HE MAY EVEN BECHARGED A FINE, UP TO ABOUT 1000 POUNDS(ÁPPROX. 1500 ÁMERICAN DOLLARS) FOREVERY SINGLE PIECE OF PIRATED SOFTWARETHAT HE HAS.  ÁS MOST ÁMERICANS WILLAGREE, THIS IS VERY DIFFERENT FROM THEWAY LAW ENFORCEMENT AGENCIES HANDLESOFTWARE PIRACY HERE IN THE STATES.     ÔHE DETAILS OF ÓTUART'S LEGALPUNISHMENT  HAVE  NOT  YET  BEENASCERTAINED; HE WILL FIND OUT WHEN ANDIF  HE  HAS  TO  GO  TO  COURT,  ANDSPECIFICALLY WHAT THE CRIMINAL CHARGESAGAINST HIM ARE ON THE 23RD OF ÍAY.ÈOWEVER, JUDGING BY THE TROUBLE ÂRITISHÔELECOM AND Æ.Á.Ó.Ô. HAVE GONE TO INCARRYING OUT THIS MASSIVE RAID, É DOUBTTHEY ARE JUST GOING TO GIVE HIM, OR ANYOF THE OTHER PEOPLE BUSTED, A SLAP ONTHE WRIST.     ÔHE  RAIDS  DURING  ÏPERATIONÓOUTHHALL HAVE CAUSED QUITE AN IMPACTON THE PEOPLE THAT PHREAK AND PIRATE INÅNGLAND.  ÓTU SAYS THAT MANY PHREAKSHAVE BEEN "LAYING LOW" SINCE THE BUSTS.ÔHE  USE  OF  CREDIT  CARDS, AND  OFCOURSE  BLACK  BOXES,  HAVE  DECLINEDCONSIDERABLY.  ÁLTHOUGH ÂRITISH ÔELECOMHAS FINISHED WITH ÏPERATION ÓOUTHHALL,IT SEEMS UNLIKELY THAT THIS WILL BETHEIR  LAST  ACTION  OF  THIS  TYPE.Æ.Á.Ó.Ô. HAS NOT RELENTED AND STILLCONTINUES THEIR WAR ON SOFTWARE PIRACY.     ÔHE POINT OF THIS ARTICLE?  ×ELL,É GUESS THERE REALLY ISN'T MUCH OF APOINT TO THIS, OTHER THAN TO PROVIDECONCISE, ACCURATE INFORMATION ABOUTWHAT   HAPPENED   DURING   ÏPERATIONÓOUTHHALL.  ÍAYBE TO SHOW JUST ANOTHEREXAMPLE OF THE SERIOUS STEPS COMPANIESARE TAKING TO STOP PHREAKING.-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-          ×HAT ÉS Á ÔRUE ÅLITE           WRITTEN BY Ð ÂASS-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-ÔHE PURPOSE OF THIS SERIES OF ARTICLESIS TO POINT OUT THE REGRESSING STATE OFTHE ÃOMMODORE ELITE IN THIS COUNTRY.  ÉHAVE BEEN SOMEWHAT OF A WITNESS TO THISDECLINE  AND  HAVE  TRIED  HERE  TOOBJECTIVELY POINT OUT THE CAUSE ANDEFFECT OF THIS REGRESSION.  ÉN ADDITIONÉ HAVE ALSO ATTEMPTED TO SOLVE THISPROBLEM WITH PRACTICAL SUGGESTIONS.ÔHESE ARTICLES WILL COVER THE FOLLOWINGTOPICS:ÐART É   ×HAT ÉS Á ÔRUE ÅLITEÐART ÉÉ  ÄRIVING ÏUT ÔHE ÌAMENESS          ÁMONG ÕS...ÐART ÉÉÉ ÆORMATION ÏF ÅLITE ÃOUNCILÐART ÉÖ  ÅLITE ÔRAINEES ÁND ÔHEIR          ÉMPORTANCE ÔO ÏUR ÓURVIVAL ÐART É--------×HAT ÉS Á ÔRUE ÅLITE×RITTEN ÂY:  Ð ÂASS-ÓÙÓÏÐ             ÔHE ×AREZ ÃHANNEL             (817) 565-1421 20 ÍEGS             ÆOR ÔRUE ÅLITES ÏNLY                 ----ÔHERE ARE SEVERAL WAYS IN WHICH ANOTHERWISE LAME USER CAN DISTINGUISHHIMSELF AS AN ELITE USER.  ÔHEY ARE ASFOLLOWS:  1) ÈACKING - ÁS A HACKER OF SYSTEMS     AND/OR CODES THIS SYSTEM RAPIST     SUPPLIES OTHER ELITES WITH THE     FRESHEST OF INFORMATION.  ×ITHOUT     THE FAITHFUL HACKER WE WOULD ALL     BE  CALLING  TOLL  OR  NOT  EVEN     CALLING AT ALL....  2) ÓÙÓÏÐING - ÙES  É  AM  THE  FIRST     TO ADMIT THAT É HAVE INCLUDED THIS     FOR SELFISH REASONS BUT THERE ARE     JUST AS MANY VALID POINTS HERE AS     WELL.  ÁNYONE READING THIS WHO HAS     LOGGED ON TO ANY OF MY BOARDS     KNOWS THAT É HANDLE BOARDS THAT     ARE WELL PROGRAMMED, VERY WELL     ORGANIZED, AND THAT DO NOT PERMIT     THE EXISTENCE OF LOCALS/LAMERS     (WITH EXCEPTION OF TRAINEES -- SEE     ARTICLE FOUR).  ÔHE RULES FOR MY     SYSTEM ARE SPELLED RIGHT OUT AND     CONSISTENTLY APPLIED...IF YOU FUCK     UP YOU SIMPLY DISAPPEAR.  ×ITHOUT     THE TRULY ELITE ÓÙÓÏÐS THERE WOULD     BE NO GROUPS, AND NO WIDESPREAD     WARES DISTRIBUTION...SHIT, WE AL